\b UpNext\b0  picks what to play next from the games you already own.\par
This installs UpNext for you only, in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\UpNext, without administrator rights. It adds UpNext to the Start menu and puts the upnext command on your PATH for new terminals.\par
Your library, settings and keys stay in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\upnext. Uninstalling UpNext leaves that folder alone, so installing it again picks up where you left off. To remove them too, delete that folder after uninstalling.\par
